art":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"accordion_row_FgCD33":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Materials","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_JNEfLr":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Each Sun Salt Silver piece is handcrafted using sterling and fine silver with natural stones chosen for their character, color, and story.<\/p><p>I work primarily with turquoise, opal, gemstones, shark tooth fossils, and other stones that feel grounded and alive. No two stones are identical — natural variations are part of the beauty.<\/p><p>All jewelry is made by hand in my studio using traditional silversmithing techniques. The result is work that feels substantial, personal, and meant to be worn for years.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_JNEfLr"]},"accordion_row_BfrbPx":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Care & Longevity","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_ThxGLr":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Sun Salt Silver jewelry is made to be worn and lived in. With a little care, your piece will keep its beauty for years.<\/p><p>Because many designs feature natural stones like turquoise, opal, shell, or fossilized materials, treat your jewelry gently.<\/p><p><strong>A few simple guidelines:<\/strong><\/p><p>• Remove before swimming, showering, or working with your hands<br\/>• Avoid lotions, perfumes, and cleaning products<br\/>• Store pieces separately to prevent scratching<br\/>• Gently polish silver with a soft cloth when needed<\/p><p>Natural stones can be sensitive to water and chemicals. Keeping your jewelry dry and stored safely will help preserve its color and finish.<\/p><p>For detailed care instructions, visit the <a href=\"\/pages\/jewelry-care-guide-keep-your-piece-as-bold-as-the-day-you-got-it\" title=\"Jewelry Care Guide | Keep Your Piece as Bold as the Day You Got It\">Jewelry Care page.<\/a><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_ThxGLr"]},"accordion_row_x6KaR6":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Shipping, Returns & Support","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_XCb4Fi":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>All packages are insured and include tracking. <\/strong><\/p><p>Returns are accepted within 14 days of delivery for unworn pieces in original condition and packaging.<\/p><p><strong>Not eligible for return:<\/strong> Custom work, pieces finished to size, sale items, and gift cards.<\/p><p>If your order arrives damaged or there's an issue, reach out right away — I'll make it right.<\/p><p><strong>Questions?<\/strong> Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@sunsaltsilver.com\" target=\"_blank\">hello@sunsaltsilver.com<\/a><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_XCb4Fi"]}},"block_order":["accordion